id; NS, not significant; SD, standard deviation; CRP, C-reactive protein; WBC, white blood cell count.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Relationship of various independent variables with positive amniotic fluid cultures analyzed by overall logistic regression</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-22-713-i002"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>NS, not significant; CRP, C-reactive protein; WBC, white blood cell count; AF, amniotic fluid.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>